sarwar ke wafadaar abbas kaha'n ho<br>
lo aagaya bazaar abbas kaha'n ho<br>
<br>
ye kucha-o-bazaar ye aghiyaar ka lashkar <br>
sadqe ke khajoor aur to kisi haath me pathhar <br>
marjaye na geerat se kahi'n abid e bimaar<br>
<br>
is aalame ghurbat me rasan basta hai haalat <br>
abbas bulaati hai tumhe gheerate sadaat <br>
aane me na ab der karo sheh ke wafadaar<br>
<br>
soncho to zara aale payambar ke muhafiz <br>
ghazi mere bhai meri chadar ke muhafiiz <br>
ye shaam ka bazaar kuja itrate athaar<br>
<br>
waada hai kabhi pyaas se na aahe'n bharegi <br>
paani ki sakina bhi shikayat na karegi <br>
dariya se chale aao do-aalam ke madadgaar<br>
<br>
zindaan-e-musibat me sakina huwi be aas <br>
dariya se chale aao zara der ko abbas <br>
duniya se guzarjaye na ghut ghut keye ghamkhaar<br>
<br>
haathau me rasan hai isey dafnaungi kaise <br>
is qaide museebat me kafan laungi kaise <br>
ghurbat me sakina ki shahadat ke hai'n aasaar<br>
<br>
hai saqt musibat ki ghadi aale nabi par <br>
pohncho meri imdaad ko aye mere baradar <br>
ab dakhila-e-ahle haram hai sare darbaar<br>
<br>
darbaar me lejaate hai'n be-maqna-o-chadar <br>
shayed mujhe mujboor samjhte hai'n sitamgar <br>
aajao zara lashkar-e-sarwar ke alamdaar<br>
<br>
riqqat hai sare farshe aza hashr bapa hai <br>
ashkon se bilal e shahe wala ne likha hai <br>
wo bain ke rota hai har ek sheh ka azadaar<br>
